    [Doc] Remove DeepSeek V4 Flash Vision documentation (#19629)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Remove the entire DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp documentation from the
    docs site:
    
    - Delete the English model tutorial and its Chinese translation catalog.
    - Remove the MkDocs navigation entry and localized navigation titles.
    - Remove its model support-matrix row and tutorial link.
    
    Based on upstream main at 3c088bc78. This change only removes
    documentation.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No runtime behavior changes. The DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp
    documentation and its site entries are removed.
    
